<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 19:30:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>特朗普的人工智能策略推动了华尔街疯狂的感恩节周</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/trump-s-ai-gambit-fuels-wild-thanksgiving-week-on-wall-street</link><description>华盛顿本周发出的信息是明确无误的：美国必须不惜一切代价赢得与中国的人工智能竞赛，并且政府准备进行干预以实现这一目标。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/trump-s-ai-gambit-fuels-wild-thanksgiving-week-on-wall-street'&gt;特朗普的人工智能策略推动了华尔街疯狂的感恩节周&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Trump’s AI Gambit Fuels Wild Thanksgiving Week on Wall Street&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/trump-s-ai-gambit-fuels-wild-thanksgiving-week-on-wall-street</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 18:43:36 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>风险偏好回归，铜价自 11 个月低点反弹</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/copper-rebounds-from-11-month-low-on-return-of-risk-appetite</link><description>铜价与亚洲科技股一起从 11 个月低点反弹，因人工智能交易担忧引发的数周波动后，市场风险偏好有所回升。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/copper-rebounds-from-11-month-low-on-return-of-risk-appetite'&gt;风险偏好回归，铜价自 11 个月低点反弹&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Copper Surges Most in Seven Months as Risk Appetite Returns&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/copper-rebounds-from-11-month-low-on-return-of-risk-appetite</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 03:33:07 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</link><description>周四，亚洲股市可能会在科技股上涨的基础上推动美国股指期货上涨，风险偏好复苏的迹象提振了包括铜和比特币在内的资产。也门胡塞武装袭击了沙特一家重要炼油厂后，油价上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap'&gt;亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：S&amp;P 500 Has Best Week Since April 2025 on AI Rally: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 21:59:57 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>股市上涨削弱避险需求，国债回落</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/treasuries-retreat-as-gains-in-equities-sap-demand-for-havens</link><description>随着感恩节假期后市场重新开放，美国国债交投清淡，亚洲股市上涨抑制了对避险资产的需求。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/treasuries-retreat-as-gains-in-equities-sap-demand-for-havens'&gt;股市上涨削弱避险需求，国债回落&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Treasuries Drop as Stock Rise Saps Demand for Haven Bonds&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/treasuries-retreat-as-gains-in-equities-sap-demand-for-havens</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 02:43:08 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>美联储利率走势和人工智能股票本周波动较大，金价稳定</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/gold-steadies-as-fed-rate-path-and-ai-stocks-frame-volatile-week</link><description>交易员权衡美联储加息的前景与美国科技股反弹推动的更广泛市场复苏，金价企稳。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/gold-steadies-as-fed-rate-path-and-ai-stocks-frame-volatile-week'&gt;美联储利率走势和人工智能股票本周波动较大，金价稳定&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Gold Rises as Rebound in Tech Stocks Helps Revive Risk Appetite&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/gold-steadies-as-fed-rate-path-and-ai-stocks-frame-volatile-week</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 23:53:35 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>